01010          JOB  PDAP-PRINT DIRECTORY AND PERMUTE - NOV 18, 1964        PDAP 
01020          CTL  431                                                    PDAP 
01030*                                                                     PDAP 
01040* PROGRAMMERS - CARL KURTZ AND DONNA MONTGOMERY                       PDAP 
01050*                                                                     PDAP 
01060*  PURPOSE OF THIS PROGRAM IS TO CREATE THE CAPR                      PDAP 
01070*    DIRECTORY AND AN INDEX RECORD FILE                               PDAP 
01080*                                                                     PDAP 
01090*  INPUT IS MAC-CAPR MASTER FILE                                      PDAP 
01100*                                                                     PDAP 
01110* OUTPUTS ARE-                                                        PDAP 
01120* 1. ON-LINE PRINTOUT OF CAPR DIRECTORY - OPTIONAL.                   PDAP 
01130* 2. PRINT TAPE FOR OFF-LINE CAPR DIRECTORY - OPTIONAL.               PDAP 
01140* 3. INDEX RECORD FILE - OPTIONAL.                                    PDAP 
01150*                                                                     PDAP 
01160*  TAPE UNIT ASSIGNMENTS                                              PDAP 
01170*    UNIT 1 - CAPR DIRECTORY PRINT TAPE                               PDAP 
01180*    UNIT 2 - MAC-CAPR MASTER FILE                                    PDAP 
01190*    UNIT 3 - MIR-INDEX RECORD FILE                                   PDAP 
01200*                                                                     PDAP 
01210*  DATE CONTROL CARD SHOULD FOLLOW OBJECT DECK                        PDAP 
01220*    COLUMNS 6-17 ARE CALENDAR DATE-FORMAT-JAN 15, 1964               PDAP 
01222*    COLUMNS 18-22 FOR CREATE DATE FOR MIR HEADER LABEL.              PDAP 
01230*    COLUMN 23 IS RUN TYPE, B FOR BASIC, S FOR                        PDAP 
01240*       SUPPLEMENTAL                                                  PDAP 
01250*    COLUMNS 24-28 ARE 5-DIGIT DATE IN FORMAT -YYDDD-                 PDAP 
02010*       WHERE YY IS LAST 2 DIGITS OF YEAR AND DDD                     PDAP 
02020*       IS DAY OF YEAR. THIS DATE IS USED TO DETERMINE                PDAP 
02030*       WHETHER AN ENTRY WILL BE PROCESSED ON SUPPLEMENTAL RUNS.      PDAP 
02031*       ENTRIES WITH ACTIVITY DATE EQUAL TO OR LATER THAN THIS        PDAP 
02032*       DATE WILL BE PRINTED.                                         PDAP 
02040*                                                                     PDAP 
02050*  SENSE SWITCHES                                                     PDAP 
02060*    IO AND A ON                                                      PDAP 
02070*    B ON FOR ON-LINE PRINT.                                          PDAP 
02072*    C ON FOR PRINT TAPE OUTPUT - TOD.                                PDAP 
02074*    D ON TO PRODUCE INDEX RECORD OUTPUT - MIR.                       PDAP 
02080*    ALL OTHERS OFF                                                   PDAP 
02090*******************************************************************   PDAP 
02100*  HALT LISTING AND ACTION TO BE TAKEN                                PDAP 
02102*******************************************************************   PDAP 
02110*    A-ADDR      REASON FOR HALT AND ACTION NECESSARY                 PDAP 
02120*                                                                     PDAP 
02130*     510      TAPE ERROR WRITING DIRECTORY-PRESS START               PDAP 
02140*                TO TRY 10 MORE TIMES                                 PDAP 
02150*     511      END OF REEL ON DIRECTOTY FILE-MOUNT                    PDAP 
02160*                SCRATCH, PRESS START                                 PDAP 
02170*     520      OUT OF SEQUENCE ON MAC FILE-ABANDON JOB                PDAP 
02180*     521      TAPE ERROR READING MAC FILE-PRESS START                PDAP 
02190*                TO TRY 10 MORE TIMES                                 PDAP 
02200*     525      TAPE ERROR READING HEADER OR TRAILER ON                PDAP 
02210*                MAC FILE-PRESS START TO TRY AGAIN                    PDAP 
02220*     529      END OF REEL ON MAC FILE-MOUNT NEXT                     PDAP 
02230*                INPUT, PRESS START                                   PDAP 
02240*     530      TAPE ERROR WRITING ON INDEX TAPE-PRESS                 PDAP 
02250*                START TO TRY 10 MORE TIMES                           PDAP 
03010*     531      END OF REEL ON INDEX TAPE-MOUNT SCRATCH,               PDAP 
03020*                PRESS START                                          PDAP 
03030*     536      TAPE ERROR WRITING HEADER ON INDEX FILE- PRESS         PDAP 
03040*                START TO TRY AGAIN                                   PDAP 
03050*     537      TAPE ERROR WRITING TRAILER ON INDEX FILE-PRESS         PDAP 
03060*                START TO TRY AGAIN                                   PDAP 
03061*     600      CONTROL CARD ERROR - RUNOUT CARD WITH NON PROCESS      PDAP 
03062*              RUN OUT READ KEY - CORRECT CARD AND PLACE IN HOPPER    PDAP 
03063*              AND PRESS START.                                       PDAP 
03064*                THE ERROR COULD BE-                                  PDAP 
03065*                 1. BLANK REPORT DATE.                               PDAP 
03066*                 2. IMPROPER RUN TYPE - NOT B OR S.                  PDAP 
03067*                 3. IMPROPER SUPPLEMENT DATE FOR S RUN.              PDAP 
03068*                 4. IMPROPER CREATE DATE FOR MIR OP HEADER LABEL.    PDAP 
03070*     601      INVALID INSTALLMENT CODE IN MAC RECORD-                PDAP 
03080*                ABANDON JOB                                          PDAP 
03090*     606      WRONG LENGTH RECORD ON MAC-ABANDON JOB                 PDAP 
03100*     621      FIRST RECORD ON MAC REEL NOT A HEADER LABEL - MOUNT    PDAP 
03102*              CORRECT REEL AND PRESS START.                          PDAP 
03104*     622      HEADER LABEL ON DRIVE 2 SHOWS THAT REEL IS NOT         PDAP 
03122*              IDENTIFIED AS MAC - MOUNT CORRECT REEL AND             PDAP 
03124*              PRESS START.                                           PDAP 
03128*     623      IMPROPER REEL SEQUENCE ON MAC INPUT FILE - MOUNT       PDAP 
03130*              CORRECT REEL AND PRESS START.                          PDAP 
03140*     631      BLOCK COUNT ON MAC TRAILER IS OUT OF                   PDAP 
03150*                BALANCE-RESTART JOB                                  PDAP 
03160*     632      EOR-EOF INDICATOR ON MAC TRAILER IS                    PDAP 
03170*                INVALID-ABANDON JOB                                  PDAP 
03180*     692      PROGRAM OR MACHINE ERROR-RESTART JOB                   PDAP 
03190*     999      END OF JOB                                             PDAP 
